  "description": "T1 Betula jacquemontii- Fell- \rThis tree has out grown its position in the small herbacious border and garden, it is blocking light and the roots are suppressing the growth of other ornamental shrubs and trees- The owner would like to remove it before it gets any larger- a poor choice for such a small garden, also blocking the view in to Green park.\r\rT2 Prunus sp.- Fell\rAs above \r, in addition the trees lower branches have been removed and now has impaired form, is being suppressed by the London Plane tree and it has very few blossoms in the spring.\r\rIf nessessary the tree owner would be prepared to replace the two trees with a more suitable tree",
